{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"final"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"ReducerStoreRegistry"}],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Why this exists","anchor":"Why-this-exists","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Each level of a "},{"code":"@Reducer","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" parent-child tree renders its own content via"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"_ReducerChildObservingView","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"\/"},{"code":"ReducerObservedView","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", which injects "},{"code":".environmentObject(store)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"wherever "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"that level","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" happens to render. For a single level of push navigation this is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"enough — but confirmed (device-tested, multi-level real app) to fail once a destination is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reached through more than one nested push: "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".navigationDestination"},{"type":"text","text":"\/"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NavigationLink"},{"type":"text","text":" push"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"results are anchored to the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NavigationStack"},{"type":"text","text":"\/"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NavigationView"},{"type":"text","text":" container’s own position, not"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to wherever the pushing content is currently nested, so an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@EnvironmentObject"},{"type":"text","text":" injected"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"several levels below that container is invisible to the destination regardless of "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"how","type":"text"}]},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the destination resolves it (owning the presentation control locally, as","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"_ReducerChildPresentingConnector","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" used to, does not help — the injection point itself is","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"too deep).","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The fix: inject exactly one thing at the true root — above\/at the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NavigationStack"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"container, never any deeper — and have every level register itself into ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"that","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" instead of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"adding its own environment injection. Resolving "},{"code":"ReducerStoreRegistry","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" itself via","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"@EnvironmentObject","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" always succeeds, at any depth, because its injection point never","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"moves; it isn’t a value being carried through a level-specific injection the way each","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"individual store was.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Keyed by concrete store type ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ObjectIdentifier(S.self)"},{"type":"text","text":") with a stack of weak references"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"per type — a stack so a reducer that navigates to another instance of its own type resolves"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to the innermost (currently relevant) one; weak so a store that’s genuinely torn down (its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"last strong reference gone, e.g. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"state.child = nil"},{"text":") is skipped by ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"current(_:)"},{"text":" without","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"needing an explicit removal call.","type":"text"}]},{"anchor":"Why-theres-no-pop","type":"heading","text":"Why there’s no `pop`","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An earlier revision removed a registered store on "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".onDisappear"},{"type":"text","text":". "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Confirmed on device"}]},{"text":":","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"during a nested push (a destination pushing its own child destination), SwiftUI can fire","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":".onDisappear","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" for a view that’s still logically part of the stack — without ever firing a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"matching "},{"code":".onAppear","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" afterward — as part of its path reconciliation for the nested"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"transition. Acting on that "},{"code":".onDisappear","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" permanently removed a store that was still very"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"much alive and still rendering, and nothing ever re-registered it, leaving every subsequent"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"lookup for it "},{"code":"nil","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" (symptom: the screen goes blank right as the nested push settles)."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"push","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is idempotent and safe to call on every "},{"code":"body","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" evaluation (not just "},{"code":".onAppear","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"), and"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"weak references mean a truly-gone store silently drops out of ","type":"text"},{"code":"current(_:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" on its own —","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"so there’s nothing left for an explicit ","type":"text"},{"code":"pop","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" to do that isn’t already handled, and removing","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"it removes the SwiftUI-lifecycle-timing risk entirely."}]}]}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/statoscope\/reducerstoreregistry"]}],"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Statoscope\/documentation\/Statoscope"]]},"metadata":{"symbolKind":"class","fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ReducerStoreRegistry","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"ReducerStoreRegistry"}],"externalID":"s:10Statoscope20ReducerStoreRegistryC","modules":[{"name":"Statoscope"}],"role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Class","title":"ReducerStoreRegistry"},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Statoscope\/documentation\/Statoscope\/ReducerStoreRegistry"},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"A stack of live stores per concrete store type, injected exactly ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"once"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" at the app’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"root by ","type":"text"},{"code":"ReducerStoreView","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", so any navigation destination — at any nesting depth — can","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"resolve its own live parent store without depending on that specific level’s own"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@EnvironmentObject"},{"text":" injection being reachable.","type":"text"}],"topicSections":[{"generated":true,"anchor":"Initializers","title":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Statoscope\/documentation\/Statoscope\/ReducerStoreRegistry\/init()"]},{"generated":true,"anchor":"Default-Implementations","title":"Default Implementations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Statoscope\/documentation\/Statoscope\/ReducerStoreRegistry\/ObservableObject-Implementations"]}],"relationshipsSections":[{"kind":"relationships","title":"Conforms To","type":"conformsTo","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Statoscope\/7Combine16ObservableObjectP"]}],"references":{"doc://Statoscope/documentation/Statoscope/ReducerStoreRegistry":{"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/statoscope\/reducerstoreregistry","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Statoscope\/documentation\/Statoscope\/ReducerStoreRegistry","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"ReducerStoreRegistry"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"ReducerStoreRegistry"}],"title":"ReducerStoreRegistry","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A stack of live stores per concrete store type, injected exactly "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"once"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" at the app’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"root by "},{"code":"ReducerStoreView","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", so any navigation destination — at any nesting depth — can"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"resolve its own live parent store without depending on that specific level’s own"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"@EnvironmentObject","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" injection being reachable."}],"type":"topic"},"doc://Statoscope/documentation/Statoscope":{"title":"Statoscope","type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"A lightweight library for managing state in iOS applications, designed with simplicity, testability, and scalability in mind.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Statoscope\/documentation\/Statoscope","url":"\/documentation\/statoscope","role":"collection"},"doc://Statoscope/documentation/Statoscope/ReducerStoreRegistry/init()":{"url":"\/documentation\/statoscope\/reducerstoreregistry\/init()","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/Statoscope\/documentation\/Statoscope\/ReducerStoreRegistry\/init()","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"init"},{"kind":"text","text":"()"}],"title":"init()","abstract":[]},"doc://Statoscope/documentation/Statoscope/ReducerStoreRegistry/ObservableObject-Implementations":{"role":"collectionGroup","url":"\/documentation\/statoscope\/reducerstoreregistry\/observableobject-implementations","kind":"article","identifier":"doc:\/\/Statoscope\/documentation\/Statoscope\/ReducerStoreRegistry\/ObservableObject-Implementations","title":"ObservableObject Implementations","abstract":[],"type":"topic"},"doc://Statoscope/7Combine16ObservableObjectP":{"title":"Combine.ObservableObject","type":"unresolvable","identifier":"doc:\/\/Statoscope\/7Combine16ObservableObjectP"}}}